  message: "Fixed in PR #3797. _compute_stable_id now folds class body shape (sorted method/field/base names) into the hash for ClassDef nodes; bumps STABLE_ID_SCHEME v2 -> v3. Secondary fix: isinstance broadened to include AsyncFunctionDef. 10 property tests pin the contract. Full pytest 14475/14475 passed, 100% coverage held. Awaits BROAD bakeoff to validate the quantitative claim (91% collision rate -> much lower) on self-analysis."  # d23d
